		"description": "<p><em>Gadget — A concealed pistol shot that ignores Rushed Attack rules.</em></p><p><strong>1 Action.</strong> Reach 2. Make an attack with a pistol, ignoring Rushed Attack rules.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> Make an attack against all enemies in Reach 2, ignoring Rushed Attack rules.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> Firearms have +1 Ammo.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Grants the Hidden Pistol gadget item (activation, 1 scrap) and the \"Hidden Pistol (Toolbelt)\" feature (upgrade, 2 scraps); both spend from your Toolbelt pool — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[A] Passive: Firearms have +1 Ammo (raises each firearm's Ammo counter).</em></p>",
